# Dynamic zero divisors for tests/contract/mathck_divmod_safety.sh, one row per
# type and operator: dialects|type|left|op|exact stderr. The suite fills
# divmod_zero.pas and prepends {$MATHCK+} or {$MATHCK-}: the zero check is
# mandatory under both. The operator is then at line 9 column 21; stdout is
# prefix/left/right (each operand evaluated once, left first). Unsigned left
# operands are 2^width - 1.
both|INTEGER|-7|DIV|runtime error: MATHCK signed division by zero in DIV at line 9 column 21 (left=-7, right=0)
both|INTEGER|-7|MOD|runtime error: MATHCK signed division by zero in MOD at line 9 column 21 (left=-7, right=0)
